{"last_node_id": 111, "last_link_id": 24, "nodes": [{"id": 50, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [20, 20], "size": [440, 520], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "widgets_values": ["**Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 — édition par instruction, jusqu'à 3 images**\n\n1. *Image 1* : l'image à modifier. **La sortie a son cadrage et ses proportions** (ramenée à ~1 Mpx).\n2. *Image 2* / *Image 3* (facultatives, violettes = désactivées) : sélectionner → **Ctrl+B**, puis charger une image\n   (une personne, un objet, une voiture, un décor…).\n3. **Instruction** en anglais (ou en chinois), en désignant les images : `image 1`, `image 2`, `image 3`.\n   Ex. : `The family from image 2 sits inside the car from image 1, the man is driving. Keep their faces identical.`\n4. Ctrl+Entrée → `output\\QwenEdit_*.png`.\n\nRéglages :\n- **Rapide (défaut)** : LoRA Lightning actif, KSampler **4 pas, CFG 1**.\n- **Qualité max** : désactiver *LoRA Lightning* (Ctrl+B) et passer le KSampler à **40 pas, CFG 4** (≈ 10× plus long).\n- Le modèle (20 Go) dépasse les 16 Go de VRAM : fermer les applis gourmandes (jeux, navigateurs chargés)."], "title": "Mode d'emploi"}, {"id": 10, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "pos": [20, 580], "size": [440, 200], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "links": [1]}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "widgets_values": ["Replace the cyberpunk city with a sunny Mediterranean fishing harbour in daylight, colorful boats and white houses. Keep the man, his pose, his outfit and the camera angle exactly identical."], "title": "Instruction"}, {"id": 37, "type": "UNETLoader", "pos": [500, 20], "size": [340, 90], "flags": {}, "order": 0, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "links": [2]}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_edit_2511_